msgid "PDF Forms Filler for WPForms"
msgstr "PDF Formulieren Invuller voor WPForms"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: pdf-forms-for-wpforms.php:4
msgid "https://pdfformsfiller.org/"
msgstr "https://pdfformsfiller.org/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: pdf-forms-for-wpforms.php:5
msgid "Build WPForms from PDF forms. Get PDFs filled automatically and attached to email messages and/or website responses on form submissions."
msgstr "Bouw WPForms vanuit PDF-formulieren. Laat PDF's automatisch invullen en bijvoegen aan e-mailberichten en/of website-antwoorden bij formulierinzendingen."

